    "$t": "黛綠年華"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<br />\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.9613179671578109\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">吳瑞琪</span></span></b><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\"><br /></span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">合身白綿衫</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">浸青格仔裙</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">高tsâng紅靴筒</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">手尖腳幼好身胚</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">細妹伶俐靚ne-ne</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\"></span><br />\n<a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">心似浮雲多把變</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">東片乍晴一陣風</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">西片落雨出天弓</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">愛花愛月愛星光</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">細妹笑容謎樣心</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\"><br /></span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">嬌sîi潑潑行kiâm來</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">芬芳水邊野薑花一蕊</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">自開自香自幽雅</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">水流風過揚葉仔停</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">細妹心肝自精靈</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">Khiù-khiù雲絲長腰腰</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">胭脂紅脣一彎月牙笑</span><br />\n<div>\n<br /></div>\n"
  },
